{"name":"12-2-2E","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"207","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I never thought it'd be so hard to operate without being able to shoot..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're lucky the enemies' sensors aren't particularly good... They don't seem to be able to scan us. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"An entire convoy will be passing by 15 meters away in ten seconds."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Got it... I see them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Steady... Steady... Alright, they have their backs to us! Cross the road now!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We did it... That was really close. Can you make out the locations of the other enemies?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can only hack units that are close by... I don't want to be too conspicuous. We're dead if they notice our presence."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've picked up some weapons and ammo, but they don't match our Imprints so don't expect anything amazing."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All the more reason we have to be extra careful. Slipping away right under the enemies' nose without making a single peep is our only chance."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But even if we aren't discovered, time is still a problem if we just keep crawling our way through this rubble bit by bit. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If Ange and the others manage to get out, they'll leave this area as fast as they can. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Once they go beyond our signal range...then we..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk... I see your point... But we don't really have any other choice, unless..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Unless you can move in a way that's completely invisible to your enemies – like ghosts.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"!!","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Surprised?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"m_avg_labyrinth","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But weren't you...","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Left behind in the white units' system?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you hadn't attempted to hack them, I probably couldn't have found you. Sadly, you don't really have a choice.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So we meet again. It must be fate.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk...","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was working so hard trying to help you, yet you gave me the slip just like that. Don't you feel the slightest bit guilty?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're only helping me to achieve your own goal. When it comes to you, there's nothing to feel guilty about.","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Really? Really now...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Really. I'm my real self only when you aren't meddling.","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hmm... I was going to come back and help you get out of here.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I've changed my mind.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What...are you trying to do?","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All this time, I've been helping you for your sake, but you let me down again and again.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't need your help, and I certainly don't need you!","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's time I make your realize just how weak you actually are.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you think you can get out of this on your own, then prove it.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, no one will be there to pick up the slack for you this time. You must taste the consequences of your failure for yourself.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dammit! You're drawing the enemies to us?!","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4, what's wrong? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Spacing out again?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was just searching for the best route to take. We...we have to run! Now!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But aren't we supposed to keep out of sight..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We don't have time for that! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Hurry! Follow me!"}]}]}]}
